[02:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'upgrade in recent years. The package manager has been changed from the venerable OPKG to APK. This is the Alpine Linux package format , which ensures proper dependency resolution even for tiny memory chips. Finally, a'

[02:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'built-in update tool has appeared , so upgrading to a new major version no longer requires prayers. Service updates are released regularly, like clockwork. Version 25.12.5 was released in July. And the firmware selection website'

